From e42c00b690c7c0c599b7bc6614bd2b125b7e0642 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: raold <868138+raold@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 03:08:25 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 49/49] fix(Raid/Yogg): Keep rescued members and stage exit
 routes

Reserve a Constrictor victim in the frozen team so a brief attachment does not leave a portal unused. Actual use keeps the vehicle and movement guards. Route exits through the existing illusion doorway to avoid exhausting the bounded smooth-path point buffer from the far end of Stormwind.
---
